WEBVTT

00:18:29.561 --> 00:18:31.808
poderão dizer:

00:18:31.832 --> 00:18:33.506
"Nós conseguimos

00:18:33.530 --> 00:18:34.913
e então, dançamos".

00:18:37.242 --> 00:18:40.237
(Vídeo) (Música)

00:18:44.797 --> 00:18:45.947
SG: Obrigada.

00:18:46.825 --> 00:18:48.834
(Aplausos)

00:18:51.758 --> 00:18:52.916
MP: Obrigado.

00:18:52.940 --> 00:18:54.939
(Aplausos)